---
import {withBase,withBaseSrcset} from '../lib/urls';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import {profile,services} from '../data/site';
import {agents} from '../data/portfolio';
---
<Layout title="Contact & Voiceover Auditions" description="Contact British voiceover artist Kitty Kelly about a project, custom audition or directed recording session. Email kittykellyvo@outlook.com.">
 <section class="inner-hero"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK</p><h1>What’s your <em>story?</em></h1><p class="intro">A script ready to go? An idea taking shape?<br/>Let’s find the right voice for it.</p></section>
 <section class="section contact-grid"><div class="contact-details"><p class="eyebrow">STRAIGHT TO KITTY</p><a class="contact-link" href={withBase('mailto:'+profile.email)}>{profile.email}</a><a class="contact-link" href="tel:+447769272056">{profile.phone}</a><a class="contact-link" href="tel:+34625628893">{profile.spanishPhone}</a><p>For a quote or custom audition, share a little about the project, your script, timings and where the recording will be used.</p><p>Based in Valencia, with a base in London and remote session connections for clients further afield.</p><div class="social-links"><a href={withBase(profile.spotlight)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spotlight CV <Icon name="external" size={16}/></a><a href={withBase(profile.audible)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Audible <Icon name="external" size={16}/></a></div></div><form class="brief-form" id="brief-form" method="get" action="mailto:kittykellyvo@outlook.com"><h2>A few words to <em>get started.</em></h2><p>Build your project brief below, then open it in your email app to review and send.</p><label for="name">Your name *</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"/><label for="email">Your email *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200"/><label for="service">What are you working on?</label><select id="service" name="service">{services.map(s=><option value={s.name}>{s.name}</option>)}<option>Something else</option></select><label for="brief">Tell me about your project *</label><textarea id="brief" name="brief" required maxlength="2500" placeholder="Your idea, audience, tone, or an audition request…"></textarea><label for="timing">Timing, usage & territories</label><input id="timing" name="timing" maxlength="300" placeholder="e.g. October · UK online campaign"/><button class="button dark-button" type="submit">Open email with brief <Icon name="external" size={18}/></button><p class="form-note" id="form-status" role="status">Nothing is sent or stored by this website. You send the message from your email app.</p><noscript><p>JavaScript is off. Please use the direct email link to send your project details.</p></noscript></form></section>
 <section class="section representation"><p class="eyebrow">REPRESENTATION</p><h2>In good <em>hands.</em></h2><div class="agent-grid">{agents.map(agent=><figure><img src={withBase(agent.image)} width="300" height="120" loading="lazy" alt={agent.name}/><figcaption>{agent.name}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
 <script>function setService(){const select=document.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('#service');const value=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('service');if(select&&value&&Array.from(select.options).some(o=>o.value===value))select.value=value;}document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',setService);setService();</script>
</Layout>
